                                                                                        description
1                                                 Classical fixed-beta, fixed-global SEIR baseline.
2                                     SEIRS with dynamic local transmission and fixed global rates.
3                        SEIRS with dynamic local transmission and multi-outcome observation model.
4                                   SEIRS with dynamic local transmission and dynamic global rates.
